WEBVTT

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:02.770
You want the two of us to debut together?

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:07.310
Aren't you trying to become an entertainer 
so you can be reunited with your sister?

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:10.280
If Yaotome's making a move, 
then we can't afford to take our time.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:11.480
Sogo-kun.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:12.070
Yes!

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:12.770
Tamaki-kun.

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:13.450
Yeah.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.780
The two of you will debut.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.620
Give us a chance.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:22.910
If we can reach the level of recognition 
you're looking for, let us debut as seven.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:28.000
IDOLiSH7 has been asked to 
appear at the Music Festa.

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:37.840
I feel like...

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:39.260
A real entertainer!

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:41.970
We are entertainers!

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.890
Didn't you say that during rehearsal?

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:49.270
I wanna remember this!

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:50.930
Oh, me, too.

00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:53.070
Me, too!

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:56.120
Okay, everyone in!

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:57.240
Huh? Hey.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:00:59.240
Will we fit?

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.090
I'll take it.

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:05.210
Thanks, Manager.

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:08.630
Say cheese.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.170
Takanashi-san!

00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:17.010
Are you ready for the meeting?

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.700
Coming!

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:20.930
Sorry. I'll be right back.

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:22.850
Got it.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:23.850
See you later.

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:28.850
A live broadcast, huh?

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:32.490
They won't be able to edit out 
our mistakes, Nanase-san.

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:34.240
I know that!

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:37.570
This is a pretty tall hurdle 
for our first TV appearance.

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:39.130
Yeah.

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:41.870
Huh? Isn't this what we always do?

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:47.160
Yes. Our concerts are always live.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.420
You're right.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:51.340
Yeah, this is what we always do.

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:53.960
Yeah. Let's work hard, like always.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:59.760
And once tons of people like us...

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:03.280
The seven of us will debut.

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:15.150
Gazing at the distant sky...

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:18.700
Someday we'll make it past there

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:24.310
Build a rainbow Next Harmony!

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:31.130
We don't know what's right

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:34.340
So we Try and Jump!

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:37.510
Slamming face first into 
challenges and laughing

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:41.140
For us It's Only Way!

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:44.320
Make it shake (For Your Sky)

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:47.820
Make it reach (For Your Heart)

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:50.310
We'll change any and all kinds of pain

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:51.470
Do Live! (Yeah!)

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:52.310
Live! (Yeah!)

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:55.730
In the light!

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:56.530
(One, Two, Three, Four, Five, Six, Seven Go!)

00:02:56.530 --> 00:03:02.990
Yes Glory Days! Together 
we'll run through them

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:05.810
If your voice (Fuu!) reverberates (Dream!)

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:09.290
Then your wishes will become 
destiny (Singing New World!)

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:15.790
Give rise now to Age of Stage!

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:22.760
The future surely lies on the other side

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:25.680
Yes... It will keep on evolving

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:29.060
Our WiSH VOYAGE

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:35.310
Build a rainbow Next Harmony!

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:52.870
I'm really nervous!

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:58.670
Come to think of it, shouldn't we go 
say hello to the other performers?

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.920
Without our manager?

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.560
It doesn't matter.

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:05.470
We should be able to greet 
the other groups on our own.

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:07.550
Then let's go.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:10.390
I'm just getting nervous
 just waiting around.

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:15.360
Who should we start with?

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:17.150
The veterans, right?

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:19.280
My vote's Re:vale!

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:21.210
I wanna visit Re:vale!

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:23.150
We're just saying hello, brother.

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:27.660
Oh, right.

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:30.830
Nanase-san, you should go 
back to the greenroom.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:31.780
What?

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:36.900
You were just wondering if you could 
go say hello to TRIGGER, weren't you?

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:39.590
W-Well, we are performing together.

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.340
Are you stupid?

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:44.370
Please don't do anything 
to stress yourself out.

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:46.140
It could be an emotional reunion!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.930
"Bro, good to see you again! It's Riku!"

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:49.120
<b>I'm Nanase.</b>

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:51.160
<b>I'm Kujo Tenn.</b>

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:52.310
"What? Who are you?"

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:54.010
"B-But..."

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:56.030
"I'm having an asthma attack!"

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:59.130
That's what your "emotional 
reunion (lol)" would look like.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:57.120
<b>I'm Izumi Iori.</b>

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:01.150
Any other questions?

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.150
You piss me off...

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:05.150
What's more important?

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:08.000
Your brother, or IDOLiSH7?

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.800
Isn't it obvious?

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:11.160
Then you'll have to stay.

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:15.660
Fine.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.790
Don't worry.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:20.170
We'll say hello to your brother 
for you if we see him.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:23.810
Please do.

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:34.890
Thanks, Ichi.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.130
No problem.

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:38.310
He can't have an attack before the—

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:40.350
Hey, IDOLiSH7.

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:43.070
Kujo Tenn...

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.590
Iori!

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:46.450
Can you get me a warm 
drink before you come—

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:47.950
Why are you back?!

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.070
Nanase-san!

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:50.320
Huh? Hey!

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:53.580
I-It's been a while, Kujo Tenn!

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.790
Let's have a nice chat over there! Yeah?

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:59.540
Have you always been so... 
aggressively friendly?

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:03.140
Ow! I just asked for a drink.

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:04.250
I'll buy you one!

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:05.840
Now get back to the greenroom!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.150
Huh?

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:12.830
I need to meet up with the boys 
and greet the other groups.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:14.640
Manners are important in this business.

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:19.060
I'm so sorry! Are you all right?

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:21.110
You...

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:22.360
Huh?

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:24.440
What?

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:26.440
C-Could it be?

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.070
What are you doing?!

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.780
Don't go getting into
 fights with women here!

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:39.420
Are you okay?

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:41.100
Y-Yes.

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:44.600
Yaotome Gaku-san of TRIGGER?

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:50.020
I don't know if you're his lover or what, 
but you should keep your distance from him.

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:51.370
Lover?

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:53.170
Oh, no!

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:58.640
I-I'm going to be p-performing t-t-t-today!

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:00.600
You're stuttering.

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:05.630
I-I'm Takanashi Tsumugi, manager 
of Takanashi Productions' IDOLiSH7.

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:07.070
IDOLiSH7?

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:10.940
I'm sorry for what happened after 
your concert the other day.

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:13.430
I'll have the rest of the group
 come apologize later.

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:15.530
Sorry, but I'm busy.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:18.560
Oh, we look forward to 
working with you today!

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:23.280
I expect great things from you.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:27.380
Th-Thank you!

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:32.780
There she is.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:34.010
Takanashi-san!

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.530
Where? Where is it?!

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:51.610
Bring me a song better than IDOLiSH7's!

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:53.670
Where's their demo tape?!

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:56.910
It's not here, not here, not here!

00:07:57.690 --> 00:07:59.410
Why isn't it here?!

00:08:05.390 --> 00:08:08.290
I don't get Iori one bit.

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:16.220
Manager? You're back?

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:20.890
Excuse me.

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.520
Uh, hello.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.650
My inhaler...

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:35.740
What am I going to do? 
If I have an attack...

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:47.530
Riku-san!

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:50.540
Manager.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:53.090
Why are you in such a hurry?

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:55.100
You need to get on standby now!

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:56.730
There's been a change of schedule.

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:58.350
You're on in 15 minutes!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:00.470
What? Fifteen minutes?

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:04.600
The artist scheduled to 
perform hasn't arrived yet.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:05.440
Manager!

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:09.430
The director just told me we're in studio A.

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:12.820
What? The AD just told 
me to wait in studio B.

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.780
It's been changed again.

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:17.220
It's all a mess because 
it's a live broadcast.

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:18.370
Got it.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:21.050
There's no time. Let's hurry.

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:22.240
Got it.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:27.790
Nanase-san.

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:29.730
Let's go.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:38.190
Commercial is ending in three, two...

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:42.560
Music festival <i>Music Festa</i>!

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:45.500
It's already been four hours.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:47.480
How's everyone doing?

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:48.980
Yeah!

00:09:49.510 --> 00:09:51.680
Let's pump things up even more!

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:56.030
Our final performance by an indie 
artist is by that rumored group...

00:09:56.030 --> 00:10:00.130
The men who invoke storms, IDOLiSH7!

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:09.950
Listen to those cheers.

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:13.490
Now let's have them introduce themselves.

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:14.930
Nanase—

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:18.200
I'm Nanase Riku.

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:19.570
Thanks for having us.

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:22.010
You must be nervous.

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:23.810
Sorry.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:25.560
I'm Osaka Sogo.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:26.890
Thanks for having us.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.650
I'm Yotsuba Tamaki.

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:29.810
Thanks.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:33.800
Tamaki-kun, you're really 
looking for those cameras.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.900
I came because I really wanna be on TV.

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:39.170
Camera one's over there.

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.030
Wave.

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:45.370
That's not for you!

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.230
Oh, man! They're so cool!

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:52.970
I can't see.

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:56.280
So they're I-something?

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:57.800
IDOLiSH7!

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:00.010
They're not bad looking.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:02.220
I like the red-haired boy.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.910
Riku-kun, right?

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:06.780
He's really good at singing.

00:11:06.780 --> 00:11:08.140
You'd better listen.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.280
Yes, yes.

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:12.810
Okay, everyone.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:14.900
Get on standby, please.

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:20.800
<i>Nanase-san...</i>

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:23.890
<i>He's on the verge of an attack.</i>

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:26.670
Looks like they're ready.

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:31.420
This is IDOLiSH7 performing "TODAY IS."

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:36.420
<b>Rising to Popularity - Hopeful Indie Idols</b>

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:41.420
<i>It's starting.</i>

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:44.030
<i>Can he finish the song?</i>

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:47.610
<i>Should I cover for him?</i>

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:59.530
I felt the breeze that blew through 
felt the same as yesterday's

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:57.110
<i>Can Nanase-san handle the chorus?</i>

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:01.690
<i>But if he's going to make a mistake...</i>

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:09.250
But I know the same day never comes twice

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:03.570
<i>Should I ask the other members?</i>

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:06.170
<i>But how?</i>

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:08.540
<i>Hurry.</i>

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.650
<i>I need to decide quickly.</i>

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:18.550
Did you decide to take a different path now

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:33.250
<i>It can be awkward to try so 
hard when you're not used to it</i>

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:33.810
They overlapped as they covered for him.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:36.720
<i>But I've made up my mind to Reach For Smile</i>

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.900
It's fine if they do.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:40.320
When everyone backed off, they 
ended up dragging out the silence.

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:41.350
<i>I'll turn my prayers into song</i>

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:43.250
The kid who's good at dancing seems stiff.

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:46.250
<i>If even a small beat of my wings</i>

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:45.320
His mind is elsewhere.

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:47.020
This is awful.

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:51.240
<i>Can raise me up from nothing</i>

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:48.330
You see it in their faces.

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:53.130
They can't see the audience because
 they can't let go of their mistakes.

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:55.420
<i>Then I'm sure I can make anything come true</i>

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:55.420
They're not thinking about entertaining.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:13:00.390
<i>I'll make it all come true</i>

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:58.000
They might as well have left the stage.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:58.920
No.

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:01.330
The guy with glasses is keeping pace.

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:05.130
<i>No matter where you are</i>

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:05.130
And the blonde one is smiling.

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:11.760
<i>I'll play a melody you can hear</i>

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:09.090
Still cringe-worthy, though.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:12.180
They still have a chance!

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:14.500
<i>We Wish an Authentic Music</i>

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:13.560
He can't.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:16.190
He doesn't have the guts or composure.

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:20.980
<i>Ring out without hesitation</i>

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.980
Damn it! Why?

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:21.770
Gaku.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:26.350
Where are you going?

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:28.440
No point in watching any more of this.

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:29.950
We're on soon.

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:34.480
It must be hard.

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:47.150
<i>That was IDOLiSH7!</i>

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:48.970
No way...

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:52.930
Those boys you like weren't very good.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:55.650
You're wrong! Normally they're better!

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:57.480
Normally they shine brighter!

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.430
They even forgot the lyrics.

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:01.500
Well, I guess they're just newbies.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.280
You're wrong!

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:05.030
They're doing their best!

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.370
Okay, okay.

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:09.110
Stop watching TV and study.

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:12.660
No. You're wrong...

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:19.170
Yuka
What happened to IDOLiSH7...

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.610
They're finally here!

00:14:40.990 --> 00:14:44.360
Wow... Ah

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.940
The group we've all been waiting for!

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:50.950
Wow

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:50.950
TRIGGER!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:54.020
Like the blink of an eye Magic

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:58.200
I had a feeling Ready

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:02.190
The moment we passed each other

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:06.120
I'd fall in love It's a secret night

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:09.120
To an indifferent expression I say No thanks

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:13.080
So I want to make you smile

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:17.720
<i>Let's go Wake me up! <Can't wake up></i>

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:17.720
<b>Incredible performance garners
 international attention! Talented idol group</b>

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:19.870
What a wonderful performance.

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:21.730
<i>Let's dream together <Anywhere></i>

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:25.520
<i>Twilight for the two of us <Swaying></i>

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:23.610
They've got us beat.

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:26.610
Damn.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:27.420
<i>I just fall in you</i>

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:29.190
<i>I just fall in you</i>

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:32.950
<i>Swirling red Lightning</i>

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:36.120
<i>I'll give you sweet memories</i>

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:40.590
Iori! Where are you?

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:41.670
Iori!

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.120
Iori!

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:46.130
Where did he go?

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:48.550
He's not answering his phone.

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:50.380
Is he okay?

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:55.870
He's always done everything 
perfectly since he was a kid.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:58.430
He's never messed up before.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.910
Tonight was his first time.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:05.690
Iori probably forgot the 
lyrics because of me.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:10.810
I nearly had an attack, and Iori noticed.

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:12.050
It distracted him.

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:17.580
Riku.

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:24.080
You don't need to find someone 
or something to blame.

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:26.330
Yamato-san.

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:29.150
Mitsu, where would Ichi go?

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:31.020
Well...

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:32.470
Oh.

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:34.090
You have an idea?

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:39.790
I once took Iori to the place 
where I go when I'm depressed.

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:43.100
The place where my beloved Zero 
performed his final concert.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.830
The Zero Arena.

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:51.400
Iori!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:05.470
Let go of me.

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:07.330
You idiot! Why are you running?

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:11.710
Iori-san.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:12.800
Iori.

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:16.470
I'm ashamed to face all of you.

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:19.250
You worked so hard...

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:23.630
But I single-handedly ruined your dreams.

00:17:27.470 --> 00:17:28.540
I'm sorry...

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:30.610
I'm sorry!

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:31.890
Iori.

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:34.990
Iori-san, it wasn't your fault!

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:40.370
I should've known things would get 
chaotic and prepared accordingly.

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:43.610
I'm so sorry to all of you.

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:45.690
I-I'm sorry.

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:49.770
D-Don't cry, you guys.

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:53.340
Guys.

00:17:57.820 --> 00:17:58.830
Okay.

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:07.020
Nagi-san?

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:09.800
I'll dance.

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:12.530
I'll sing your favorite songs.

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:14.400
What would you like me to do?

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.110
What are you talking about?

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:19.260
Oh, I'm an idol.

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:22.050
Making people smile is my job.

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:24.350
I want you to smile.

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:28.210
See? I'm good at turns.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:31.040
I'm good at twirling.

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:34.340
I'm okay at clapping behind my back.

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:42.930
But I'm not very good at kicking.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.740
I can dance alone,

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:50.060
but I'm unimpressive on my own.

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:55.150
I need someone to help me.

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:57.150
Oh, girl.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.010
Who, me?

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:00.990
Yes. Come on.

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:16.210
Hi, lovely girl.

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:18.570
H-Hi...

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:20.580
There's a ball tonight.

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:24.330
And under the stars,
 I'll be only your prince.

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:30.460
Dance with me?

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:33.190
I've never danced before, though.

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:40.860
It's easy. Follow my lead.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:42.070
What?

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:43.930
Please, music!

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:46.380
Huh?

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:52.630
Oh. You try asking him.

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:53.580
Me?

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:58.880
Yes. This music box here doesn't take coins.

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:04.010
As long as someone asks them to sing, 
they'll come back to life countless times.

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:07.640
Like the moon waxes.

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:09.770
Like the morning sun rises.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:16.270
Our heartbeats will never, ever stop.

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:21.650
Hey! Are you ready yet?

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:24.670
Let's do it!

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:26.450
For the manager!

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:28.750
You're right.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:32.080
Our manager was our first audience.

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:33.580
Let's sing.

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:36.400
Whether after basketball,
 in an empty arena,

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:40.000
or in a storm, we've never stopped singing.

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:42.090
I don't care how uncool we look.

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:45.090
I want more people to hear and see us.

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:52.600
I felt the breeze that blew through 
felt the same as yesterday's

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:47.340
Come on, Iori.

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:49.970
We can't start without you.

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:52.080
Nanase-san.

00:20:52.920 --> 00:21:02.730
But I know the same day never comes twice

00:20:56.190 --> 00:21:00.230
I love seeing everyone smile!

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:02.730
That's why I sing!

00:21:02.730 --> 00:21:05.860
Today is the best day!

00:21:02.730 --> 00:21:11.890
Did you decide to take a different path now

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:09.380
I experienced something 
for the first time today!

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:10.750
What was it?

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:13.980
I got to cheer up my younger 
brother when he was crying!

00:21:11.890 --> 00:21:22.340
Because of the feelings you 
keep hidden in your heart?

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:17.120
Don't worry. I'm here for you.

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:17.130
Hey, wait. Nii-san.

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:19.630
You worked hard, Iori.

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:23.130
Stop that. You're embarrassing me.

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:31.950
There are skies that can be flown 
by someone as inexperienced as me

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.360
All right.

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:28.640
Manager, say the magic words.

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:35.250
Believing in that took a Braver Mind

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:40.150
I'll try sending this voice on the wind

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:37.150
Please...

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:40.150
Please, music!

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:40.150
Please, Music

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:44.750
If even a small beat of my wings

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:50.160
Can raise me up from nothing

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:54.300
Then I'm sure I can make anything come true

00:21:54.300 --> 00:21:59.050
I'll make it all come true

00:21:59.050 --> 00:22:03.730
No matter where you are

00:22:03.730 --> 00:22:10.180
I'll play a melody you can hear

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:13.460
We Wish an Authentic Music

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:19.520
Ring out without hesitation

00:22:34.510 --> 00:22:39.490
Instead of waiting for the world to change

00:22:39.490 --> 00:22:44.750
We should seize the future

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:49.060
Once we realize that we should be able to go

00:22:49.060 --> 00:22:53.530
No matter how far away

00:22:53.530 --> 00:22:58.430
I learned that the today we only imagined

00:22:58.430 --> 00:23:04.800
Can always be made anew

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:08.070
Today is Another Story

00:23:08.070 --> 00:23:12.700
Our dreams are here

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:18.640
Our dreams won't sleep anymore

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:48.280
Osaka Sogo-kun, Yotsuba Tamaki-kun.

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:49.370
Yes.

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:55.160
You will officially debut with 
Takanashi Productions.
